{
  "group_id": "polardb-storage-resizer",
  "description": "Alibaba Cloud PolarDB prepaid storage auto-resizer. Python 3.12 service (src-layout, uv, hatchling) deployed as a Kubernetes CronJob via Helm. Talks to the alibabacloud-polardb20170801 SDK. Pipeline: discover Prepaid clusters -> filter by safety rules -> compute target storage (ceil(A * buffer_percent/100)) with expand/shrink caps and 10GB step alignment -> apply in dry-run/apply modes with retry, rate limiting, and graceful shutdown.",
